  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/DeAW2_z67Gg-7JKhTmAQYPPxA9X5pIpEkMR6fTS-RXA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & I_A=\\frac{N q}{\\frac{2 \\pi}{\\omega}} \\\\ & I_A=\\frac{N q \\omega}{2 \\pi}, I_B=0 \\\\ & I_A=I_B=\\frac{N q \\omega}{2 \\pi}\\end{aligned}$",
